# Note on tracked datasets & production artifact:
# data/raw/Indian Liver Patient Dataset (ILPD).csv (~24 KB), data/processed/ (~30 KB),
# and artifacts/models/liver_disease_pipeline.joblib (~5.75 MB) are intentionally
# kept versioned for reproducible tests, Docker builds, and Render deployment.
# Migrate to Git LFS or DVC if future datasets/artifacts exceed ~25 MB.
